templ([2],'A block of mass [[m]] kg rests on a face of area [[a]] m$^2$. Calculate the pressure due to its weight.',{'m':{'choices':[2,3,4]},'a':{'choices':[0.01,0.02,0.04]}},{},'m*9.81/a','Pa',[('m/a','m2')],'First find weight $mg$, then divide by area. Omitting $g$ gives mass per area.',['The force here is the block’s weight.','Find $mg$ before using pressure.','Start with $p=mg/A$.'])
templ([3,4],'A liquid has density [[r]] kg m$^{-3}$. Calculate the pressure increase between two points separated vertically by [[h]] m.',{'r':{'choices':[800,1000,1200]},'h':{'choices':[0.2,0.4,0.6]}},{},'r*9.81*h','Pa',[('r*h','m4'),('r*9.81','m4')],'The pressure increase is $\\rho g\\Delta h$ using the liquid density.',['Identify the vertical separation.','Use the fluid density and gravitational field strength.','Write $\\Delta p=\\rho g\\Delta h$.'])
