templ([5,6],'A vertical block of cross-sectional area [[a]] m$^2$ has bottom and top pressures [[pb]] Pa and [[pt]] Pa. Calculate the upward fluid force.',{'a':{'choices':[0.01,0.02]},'pb':{'choices':[120000,130000]},'pt':{'choices':[100000,105000]}},{},'(pb-pt)*a','N',[('pb-pt','m5'),('pb*a','m5')],'The bottom pushes upwards and the top pushes downwards, so upthrust is $(p_b-p_t)A$.',['Pressure must be converted into force.','Subtract the two opposing pressure forces.','Write $F_b=p_bA$ and $F_t=p_tA$.'])
